{"4200060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tyrants Rafting", "steam_appid": 4200060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/2365f7fddced3887856b4ba4e552191a.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1080 height=86 /></span>This game is meant to be frustrating. <br>You control the left side of the boat, your buddy controls the right,<br> So even crossing a river can turn into a complete disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/f787d3313b064da82d35737787ff1e31.poster.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/f787d3313b064da82d35737787ff1e31.webm?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/f787d3313b064da82d35737787ff1e31.mp4?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/55db31468a8a24e2221ab8d33860d34f.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1080 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a relaxed co-op. <br>The rigged timer, the river, and the traps turn every checkpoint into a test of communication, trust, and panic management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/d8e53cb13884694846ff75b589b30e23.poster.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/d8e53cb13884694846ff75b589b30e23.webm?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/d8e53cb13884694846ff75b589b30e23.mp4?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/44ffcf473c54329c5029e5cef1dd6ad7.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1080 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boat turns into a pickup truck, <br>But you still control it the same way. <br>To shoot, you must turn the truck left or right and use the cursor to aim the shoots </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/41be3ba796925c54167929dd9090644a.poster.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/41be3ba796925c54167929dd9090644a.webm?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/41be3ba796925c54167929dd9090644a.mp4?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/2abca4d9240c8b565fc4c0e52eb3b86d.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1080 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special nitro pickups and transform into a golden speedboat while the iconic Syrian meme anthem kicks in.  <br>One player can steer left, the other right, <br>so the whole thing becomes intensified and cool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/89b16ce36991817e7135b1ee27484edc.poster.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/89b16ce36991817e7135b1ee27484edc.webm?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/89b16ce36991817e7135b1ee27484edc.mp4?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PEDAL<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/e59bca38cd30f25cfc4fd4e278a473d7.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1080 height=86 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a variety of infamous tyrants on the run. <br>Each tyrant comes with their own unique skin and custom voice lines<br> so you can panic and yell at your teammate in character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/9b8f6f726aad8bdaf1c6adc3e3c9edc3.poster.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/9b8f6f726aad8bdaf1c6adc3e3c9edc3.webm?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/9b8f6f726aad8bdaf1c6adc3e3c9edc3.mp4?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---- </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Cool Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌨️ <strong>R -</strong> Press R to commit a suicide, and restart the latest checkpoint!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>HAND PICKED TECHNO -</strong> The soundtrack is fast, loud, and built to make the escape feel intense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 <strong>UNIQUE TRAPS &amp; GORE</strong> — Every explosive looks, sounds, and behaves differently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚧 POST-WAR SYRIA</strong> — Explore a game world inspired by Syria, with ruined environments and a war-torn setting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---- </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/ef19c8d00aeb15a180c07db4df6e4097.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1077 height=268 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/2365f7fddced3887856b4ba4e552191a.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1080 height=86 /></span>This game is meant to be frustrating. <br>You control the left side of the boat, your buddy controls the right,<br> So even crossing a river can turn into a complete disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/f787d3313b064da82d35737787ff1e31.poster.avif?t=1781617880\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200060/extras/f787d3313b064da82d35737787ff1e31.webm?t=1781617880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.a